        "comparator": "Placebo",
        "description": "Phase 2, multicenter, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study evaluating once-daily oral KAI-7535 (dose escalation from 15 mg up to 180 mg or 360 mg/MTD across morning and evening dosing schedules) versus placebo for 44 weeks in adult participants living with obesity or overweight with at least one weight-related comorbidity."
      },
      "population": "Adult participants aged 18 years or older living with obesity (BMI >= 30 kg/m2) or overweight (BMI >= 27 kg/m2) with at least 1 weight-related comorbidity, with or without diabetes mellitus.",
